\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\tab ALL praise to our redeeming Lord,
\par \pard\li720 Who joins us by His grace,
\par And bids us, each to each restored,
\par Together seek His face.
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.\tab He bids us build each other up ;
\par \pard\li720 And, gathered into one,
\par To our high calling's glorious hop
\par We hand in hand go on.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.\tab The gift which He on one bestows,
\par \pard\li720 We all delight to prove ;
\par The grace through every vessel flows,
\par In purest streams of love.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.\tab Even now we think and speak the same,
\par \pard\li720 And cordially agree ;
\par Concentred all, through Jesu's  name,
\par In perfect harmony.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.\tab We all partake the joy of one,
\par \pard\li720 The common peace we feel,
\par A peace to sensual minds unknown,
\par A joy unspeakable.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.\tab And if our fellowship below
\par \pard\li720 In Jesus be so sweet,
\par What heights of rapture shall we know
\par When round His throne we meet.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

